{"seq":22,"slug":"cryptography-fundamentals","title":"密码学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.27,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 密码学基础\n\n密码学（Cryptography）是研究信息保密、完整性与认证的数学与工程学科——它把\"安全\"这个抽象的概念转化为可计算、可验证、可证明的算法。从凯撒大帝用替换密码加密军令、二战 Enigma 与图灵的 Bletchley Park、到现代 RSA 让互联网商业成为可能、再到 zero-knowledge proof 让 zk-rollup 重新定义区块链，密码学是计算机科学最深刻、最实用的分支之一。本 Hub 不是 cipher 大全，而是给软件工程师 / 安全工程师 / 学生的密码学工程化路径——古典密码（理解直觉）、对称密码（AES、hash、HMAC）、非对称密码（RSA、ECC、PKI）、应用密码（TLS、密码存储、ZKP）。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[密码学基础] --> B[1. 古典密码学]\n    A --> C[2. 对称密码学]\n    A --> D[3. 非对称密码学]\n    A --> E[4. 应用密码学]\n    B --> F[Caesar / Vigenère / 频率分析 / OTP]\n    C --> G[AES / 流密码 / 模式 / Hash & MAC]\n    D --> H[RSA / ECC / 数字签名 / PKI]\n    E --> I[TLS / 密码存储 / ZKP]\n```\n\n| 章节         | 核心概念                             | 应用场景              |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 古典密码学   | Substitution、置换、频率分析、信息论 | 教学 + 历史           |\n| 对称密码学   | AES、ChaCha20、SHA-256、HMAC         | 数据加密、消息完整性  |\n| 非对称密码学 | RSA、ECDH、ECDSA、X.509              | 密钥交换、签名、身份  |\n| 应用密码学   | TLS handshake、bcrypt、zk-SNARK      | HTTPS、密码、隐私计算 |\n\n学完本 Hub 你将能识别\"何时用对称、何时用非对称\"、\"为什么 MD5 不能再用\"、\"TLS 1.3 比 1.2 改了什么\"、\"密码存储为什么用 bcrypt 不是 SHA-256\"、\"zero-knowledge proof 解决了什么\"。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-cryptography","title":"古典密码学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/classical-cryptography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"caesar-and-substitution","title":"Caesar 与 Substitution Cipher","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/classical-cryptography/caesar-and-substitution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vigenere-cipher","title":"Vigenère Cipher 维吉尼亚密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/classical-cryptography/vigenere-cipher"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frequency-analysis","title":"频率分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/classical-cryptography/frequency-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"one-time-pad","title":"One-Time Pad 一次性密码本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/classical-cryptography/one-time-pad"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"symmetric-cryptography","title":"对称密码学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/symmetric-cryptography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"block-ciphers-aes","title":"Block Cipher 与 AES","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/symmetric-cryptography/block-ciphers-aes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-ciphers","title":"流密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/symmetric-cryptography/stream-ciphers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modes-of-operation","title":"运行模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/symmetric-cryptography/modes-of-operation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"hash-functions-and-mac","title":"Hash 函数与 MAC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/symmetric-cryptography/hash-functions-and-mac"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"asymmetric-cryptography","title":"非对称密码学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/asymmetric-cryptography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rsa-fundamentals","title":"RSA 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/asymmetric-cryptography/rsa-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diffie-hellman-and-ecc","title":"Diffie-Hellman 与椭圆曲线密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/asymmetric-cryptography/diffie-hellman-and-ecc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-signatures","title":"数字签名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/asymmetric-cryptography/digital-sign